  "solution": {
    "text": "$y=\\frac{3 x^2+9 x+17}{3 x^2+9 x+7}$\n$3 x^2(y-1)+9 x(y-1)+7 y-17=0$\n$D \\geq 0 \\quad \\because x$ is real\n$81(y-1)^2-4 x 3(y-1)(7 y-17) \\geq 0$\n$\\Rightarrow(y-1)(y-41) \\leq 0 \\Rightarrow 1 \\leq y \\leq 41$",
